    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958210/extras/b11c588a13a38e6f221612dbdb3cdc5f.avif?t=1715756847\" width=406 height=185 /></span><br><br><strong>Connie and the Essence of Chaos</strong> is an upcoming indie 2D platformer made by a single person.<br><br>In this game you control our limbless hero <strong>Connie</strong> and her spirit friend <strong>Plum</strong> on their quest to defeat <strong>Lucilate</strong>, an evil overlord who has taken over the island of <strong>Cuisinia</strong>. Explore a whimsical world, free every imprisoned essence fairy, unlock new powers and beat a bunch of terrifying foes!<br><br>I'm still working on the game and there is no set release date yet, but you can add it to your <strong>WISHLIST</strong> and follow <strong>UPDATES</strong> I will be posting here, on my website and on Youtube.<br>You can also find the link to my website on the side of the store page.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958210/extras/b3866f1073dea3efab90651fe0bc19af.avif?t=1715756847\" width=224 height=156 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958210/extras/b11c588a13a38e6f221612dbdb3cdc5f.avif?t=1715756847\" width=406 height=185 /></span><br><br><strong>Connie and the Essence of Chaos</strong> is an upcoming indie 2D platformer made by a single person.<br><br>In this game you control our limbless hero <strong>Connie</strong> and her spirit friend <strong>Plum</strong> on their quest to defeat <strong>Lucilate</strong>, an evil overlord who has taken over the island of <strong>Cuisinia</strong>. Explore a whimsical world, free every imprisoned essence fairy, unlock new powers and beat a bunch of terrifying foes!<br><br>I'm still working on the game and there is no set release date yet, but you can add it to your <strong>WISHLIST</strong> and follow <strong>UPDATES</strong> I will be posting here, on my website and on Youtube.<br>You can also find the link to my website on the side of the store page.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958210/extras/b3866f1073dea3efab90651fe0bc19af.avif?t=1715756847\" width=224 height=156 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Connie and the Essence of Chaos is a cute 2D adventure inspired by past platforming classics. JUMP and PUNCH your way through 6 distinct and colorful worlds on your quest to defeat the evil overlord Lucilate and free the island of Cuisinia from his reign of terror!",
